                <mxCell id="114" value="&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;Legacy Design v1.2.0&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;div&gt;This Diagram is the legacy design for the SNIP&#39;s Big RAG Plugin, which takes a relatively naive approach in conducting rag over a span of documents.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;It Simply uses embeddings and a variety of parsers to process and retrieve documents. The process is triggererd upon every AI prompt run, making it naive&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;fontSize=16;" vertex="1" parent="1">
